(19,'An internal purchase request is a ____; the order sent to the vendor is a ____.','purchase requisition; purchase order','purchase order; purchase requisition|sales order; vendor invoice|vendor invoice; sales invoice','Internal approval happens inside the buyer. Ordering from a selected supplier goes outside the organization.'),
